TASK 2. Speed: C ~ v (pooled) and C ~ truck + v (OLS, empirical residual variance). Slope in % of mean C per 10 m/s; 95% CI; equivalence if the 90% CI lies inside +-5 or +-10 %/10 m/s.

d1A: corr(truck, speed) = 0.982, VIF = 28.6; within-truck share of speed variance = 3.5%  (speeds T1: 10.4-12.8, T2: 19.1-19.8 m/s)

d2A: corr(truck, speed) = -0.380, VIF = 1.2; within-truck share of speed variance = 85.5%  (speeds T3: 16.8-28.1, T4: 13.2-23.0 m/s)

